{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Attendance Gateway API",
    "version": "1.4.0",
    "description": "Zero-Trust Cryptographic Attendance Gateway.\n\n**Authentication**\n- Most client endpoints accept a shared client API key: header `X-Api-Key: ag_...` (mint from the Admin console → API Keys).\n- Role-protected endpoints (professor/admin) use a JWT: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `/api/v1/admin/login` or `/api/v1/auth/login`.\n- Global security: `ApiKey OR bearer`; public operations (health, admin login) override with `[]`.\n\n**Building a client?** See the **Client Integration Guide** (QR / 3-second metronome protocol, biometric Gate 2 ordering, timestamp sealing, 250ms window): https://git.atmyhome.tech/het/attendance-gateway/src/branch/main/docs/CLIENT_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md\n\n**Error payloads:** every 4xx/5xx returns the envelope `{success:false,error:{code,message,latency_ms?,details?}}`. Full code table + client UI actions: **Error Dictionary** — https://git.atmyhome.tech/het/attendance-gateway/src/branch/main/docs/ERROR_DICTIONARY.md (schema: `ErrorEnvelope`).\n\n**To get an API key:** sign in to the Admin console (https://admin.atmyhome.tech) → **API Keys** → Generate Key."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.atmyhome.tech"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Health"
    },
    {
      "name": "Student"
    },
    {
      "name": "Attendance / Claim"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sessions / Professor"
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth"
    },
